      },
      "worked": "The probabilities sum to 1.\n$$\\begin{aligned}k+2k+3k+4k&=1\\\\10k&=1\\\\k&=\\frac{1}{10}\\end{aligned}$$\n$$\\begin{aligned}E(X)&=\\sum xP(x)\\\\E(X)&=1\\left(\\frac{1}{10}\\right)+2\\left(\\frac{2}{10}\\right)+3\\left(\\frac{3}{10}\\right)+4\\left(\\frac{4}{10}\\right)\\\\E(X)&=\\frac{30}{10}=3\\end{aligned}$$\n$$\\begin{aligned}E(X^2)&=\\sum x^2P(x)\\\\E(X^2)&=1^2\\left(\\frac{1}{10}\\right)+2^2\\left(\\frac{2}{10}\\right)+3^2\\left(\\frac{3}{10}\\right)+4^2\\left(\\frac{4}{10}\\right)\\\\E(X^2)&=\\frac{100}{10}=10\\\\\\operatorname{Var}(X)&=E(X^2)-\\mu^2\\\\\\operatorname{Var}(X)&=10-3^2=1\\\\\\sigma&=\\sqrt{1}=1\\end{aligned}$$",
